iday with us will let you experience the real India without having to worry about the organisational details. You can rest assured that you will have an experience to cherish. Our itineraries typically include, in addition to the major monuments at the various places, a closer look at the local way of life."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We offer both regular holidays and tailor‑made trips with an emphasis on places off the beaten track, jungle safaris and real travel experiences in addition to the cultural tours. Whatever your interests might be, our team has the knowledge and experience to create just the holiday you are looking for."}],"$L6","$L7"]}]]}]}],"$L8","$L9"]}],["$La"],"$Lb"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lc",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$d",[]],"S":true}
