6:["$","p",null,{"children":"It is our attempt to introduce you to India and help you understand its people, culture and customs, first‑hand. Be it a village visit, a rickshaw ride through the by‑lanes and old markets, staying with local families, learning an ancient art or dance form or searching for an endangered species in one of the many wildlife sanctuaries or national parks – we try to make your holiday an inspiring experience."}]
